&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注)  当期間における取得自己株式には、2024年６月１日から有価証券報告書提出日までの単元未満株式の買取り&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;    による株式数は含めておりません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DisposalsOrHoldingOfAcquiredTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(4) 【取得自己株式の処理状況及び保有状況】&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
